      <activity id="bfa5ba82-2b96-5e8c-a8c4-7862831e1345" activityNameId="16fe47a5-ba18-5569-bcd0-143e07ecb694" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, spiral-seam duct, steel, zinc coated, s= 0.5mm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, spiral-seam duct, steel, zinc coated, s= 0.5mm
Disposal of a spiral-seam duct, made of hot-dip galvanized steel sheet with 275g/m2 zinc coating, sheet thickness 0.5 mm, total weight: 4.5 kg/m2. Including average material for joining ducts. Suspension band, shock absorbing EPDM rubber, threaded rod, suspension profile for fixation on walls or ceilings.;
UUID: f97eaeef-3ddf-488c-9926-dffaa0ea143b
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f97eaeef-3ddf-488c-9926-dffaa0ea143b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
